<title>NETHERLANDS: SPEED SKATING-DUTCHMAN POSTMA IS EUROPEAN CHAMPION.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-DUTCHMAN POSTMA IS EUROPEAN CHAMPION.</headline>
<dateline>HEERENVEEN, Netherlands 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutchman Ids Postma won the men's European speed skating championship on Sunday with a points total of 157,790.</p>
<p>Fellow Dutchman and winner of the last three European championships, Rintje Ritsma, was second and Falko Zandstra, also of the Netherlands, was third.</p>
</text>
